BruceWorx changes
-----------------
All modifications are identifiable as commits prefixed "[BW]" on top of
the upstream release tag. Current changes:

  * Added BUILDING-BRUCEWORX.md (build instructions for macOS arm64 / Linux x86_64)
  * Added UPSTREAM-SYNC.md (upstream rebase policy)
  * Added this NOTICE file
  * Added .github/workflows/bruceworx-ci.yml (fork CI)

This list will be updated as features are added. BruceWorx changes are
intended to be add-ons and preference changes on standard FreeCAD rather
than rewrites of FreeCAD core code.

